{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46817","headline":"中秋十四日夜对月上南平主人 · 齐己","name":"中秋十四日夜对月上南平主人","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"今宵前夕皆堪翫，何必圆时始竭才。\n空说轮中有天子，不知何处是楼台？\n终忧明夜云遮却，且埽闲居坐看来。\n玉兔银蟾似多意，乍临棠树影裴回。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"齐己","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_46817.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_46817","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}